      {
        "severity": "major",
        "area": "signature",
        "summary": "On the product detail page, the item's drawing is one flat outline scaled up to fill a roughly 600px image box. Its 2px ink looks hairline-thin at that size, it has no visible back or side band, and on desktop the frame cuts the object off at the bottom. The reference's objects stay chunky die-cut stickers at every size: a heavy outline relative to the object, a solid rim, and the whole object kept inside its field, or cropped only on purpose at a band edge.",
        "samples": 1,
        "of": 1,
        "specCaused": false,
        "evidence": [
