        "promptFix": "A drawn image in a large media box is still a sticker. Build it with the full thick construction (back, side band, face, inner strokes), never as a single outline. Keep the object at 55–70% of the box width, centred, with at least 8% clear ground on every side, so the frame never cuts it. When the box is wider than 320px, raise the outer ink stroke to 3px, so the object keeps the same visual weight it has on a card.",
